## The teapot as the Computer History Museum shows it: in an acrylic case on a lit glass floor.
Format 1024 768 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Option "pathtracer" "integer samples" [256]
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.5 500
Imager "background" "background" [0.045 0.045 0.05]
Translate 0 -4 18
Rotate -5 1 0 0
WorldBegin
AttributeBegin
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [60] "lightcolor" [1 0.93 0.82]
Translate 0 16 -4
Rotate -90 1 0 0
Disk 0 2.5 360
AttributeEnd
ReadArchive "../../assets/museum/room.rib"
ReadArchive "../../assets/museum/museum.rib"
AttributeBegin
Rotate 180 0 1 0
ReadArchive "../../assets/teapot/teapot_tall.rib"
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
